{%- doc -%}
  This block used to display Shopify's accelerated checkout ("Buy it now" / express payment) button.
  Disabled on zootify.com (3 Nov 2026): those buttons send customers to Shopify checkout and bypass GoKwik,
  so orders skipped GoKwik's shipping and COD rules. GoKwik checkout is reached via the cart instead.

  @param {string} can_add_to_cart - Whether the product can be added to the cart
  @param form_obj - The form object
{%- enddoc -%}

